            "accordion_row_JdE99K": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How long will my Meke Milk Warmer last?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_pB378B": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>When using your warmer to retain heat, the battery life may last for 5-9 hours after one heat cycle, which gives you the advantage of keeping your water warm for an extended period. However, the battery life may vary depending on several factors such as the starting and target temperature, liquid volume, and room temperature. For instance, using 150ml at 37ºC would give you optimal battery life, whereas 300ml at 50ºC would provide the least. If you're using the warmer to heat freshly poured milk or water, your battery life will allow you to have 4-6 cycles based on usage.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
