            "accordion_row_m6D6qe": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How is the Meke Milk Warmer safer than other electronic warmers?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_cFLM3h": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We have taken every measure to ensure that our product is safe for contact with milk. We understand the importance of providing a safe and reliable product for families and have therefore chosen materials that undergo rigorous testing to ensure their safety.Our milk warmers have undergone rigorous testing and meets all the regulatory requirements for AU/NZ, EU10/2011, and CE standards, ensuring maximum quality and safety for all our customers.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 20,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_cFLM3h"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_EH3bai": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What material is the Meke Milk Warmer made from?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_jdVXgx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Tritan material used in our equipment is shatter-resistant, which means that it can withstand sudden temperature changes without breaking or cracking. As an added measure, Tritan is also BPA-free, ensuring that it is a safe and non-toxic material for warming milk. Our heating plate features a platinum silicone barrier that surrounds the SUS 316 food-grade stainless steel. Platinum silicone is a type of silicone that is considered to be of higher quality than other types of silicone, such as food-safe silicone. Platinum silicone is more durable, heat-resistant, and chemically resistant.​This combination of materials has been carefully selected for their durability and resistance to corrosion, ensuring that our product is not only safe, but also dependable for heating milk.​</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 20,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
