              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is the Express made of?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_BHNXa8": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The MEKE Baby Express is made from 316 stainless steel, known for durability and corrosion resistance. It has passed:Skin Irritation Test: Ensuring safety for a baby's delicate skin.Heavy Metal Migration Test: Ensuring no harmful metals leach into the milk.</p>",
